{"about_the_game":"After the rulers of the other planets turn down his birthday invitations, Prince Lofty of Pluto decides to invade their kingdoms and force them to attend.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Travel the Solar System reimagined in a new light. Visit planets and collect CDs to change the BGM for certain scenarios.<br></li><li>Assemble a team from a diverse selection of classes. Defeat enemy factions to unlock their color palettes for recruitment.<br></li><li>Experiment with different badge effects and varying setups.<br></li><li>Aggressive turn-based combat featuring a damage-boosting combo system and action commands.<br></li><li>Most of the game\u2019s badge drops are randomized. The main campaign can be played multiple times with different team comps and badge setups.<br></li><li>Take on the extensive postgame after the main campaign.</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clown Dictator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1511950/16747c951a841aa84208a2915ef0536d00fcea48.jpg"},{"name":"Solar Snack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1511950/73ef2ed31c3553088b13dedfd55434ad09331b2f.jpg"},{"name":"Clown School","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1511950/44950ee1ec1a56a5dc6b24d5303d6ca2c808f1f5.jpg"},{"name":"Neo Clown Fu","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1511950/e2290182861eca6c7be91729b7a4ef090fec9964.jpg"},{"name":"Wonder Guard 99","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1511950/02e387a8ee609797b657c3e2f424c30ee8f02384.jpg"}],"total":5},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1511950?t=1770000417","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1511950?t=1770000417","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1511950/cap